<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_769_2023.JPG" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser früntlich willig diennst. unnd was wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eerenn</unclear>. liebs
<lb n="2"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotz</unclear> vermoegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuovoran</unclear>. from fürsichtig. wyß. insonnders
<lb n="3"/>guott fründt. unnd gethrüwen lieben <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidtgnoßen</unclear></orgName>. Was unns
<lb n="4"/>die <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Branndenburgischen</unclear> räthe</orgName>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">roubs</unclear> unnd angriffs halben.
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üweren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgeren</unclear>. unnd ouch den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnseren</unclear> beschehen. uff disen
<lb n="6"/>tag <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogeschriben</unclear>. Das haben ir uß hierinn ver-
<lb n="7"/>schloßner coppy. desselben schribens. zuovernemen. Unnd
<lb n="8"/>moegen nun mer. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwerer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelegenheit</unclear> nach. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">harinne</unclear> wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyther</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hanndlen</unclear>. was üch nottwenndig zuo sin. beduncken will.
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wöllten</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlicher</unclear> meynung nit verhalten.
<lb n="11"/>unnd sindt üch früntlich diennst zuoerzeigen uß unnser
<lb n="12"/>vermögen wolgeneigt. Datum unnd mitt
<lb n="13"/>deß fromen. eerenvesten. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsers</unclear> gethrüwen lieben landt-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vogtz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> Baden im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-266" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Ergöw</placeName>. <persName resp="#ner">Jacoeben von der Kilchen</persName> eygnem
<lb n="15"/>insigel. innamen unnser aller <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschlossen</unclear>. uff den
<lb n="16"/><origDate when="1557" cert="medium" resp="#ner">10 tag septembris. A° lvii</origDate>°.
<lb n="17"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Von stett. unnd lannden. der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">drüzehen</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>ortten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemeiner</unclear> unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidtgnoschafft</unclear> räth
<lb n="19"/>unnd sanndtpotten. diser zit zuo Baden
<lb n="20"/>im Ergöw versampt</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_769_2024.JPG" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_769_2025.JPG" n="3"/>
<lb n="21"/>Unnser früntlich diennst zuovor. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gestrenng</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Edel</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ernnvest</unclear>. unnd
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erber</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Insonnder</unclear> liebe herren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> fründt. Waß dem durchlüchtig-
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hochgebornnen</unclear> fürsten unnd herren, her <persName resp="#ner">Geörgn Fridrichen</persName> marggraven zuo
<lb n="24"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-147" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Branndenburg</placeName>. unnserm gnedign fürsten unnd herren. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ettlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ange</unclear>-
