<lb n="28"/>unnd auch Jetzigen Jars. von etlichen unbekannten Reüttern. umb
<lb n="29"/><placeName resp="#ner">Erlebach</placeName> begegnet. Unnderthenig geschriben worden. haben wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sines</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>lenngern Innhalts verstannden. Unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachdem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochgedachtem</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserm</unclear> gnedigen fürsten unnd herren. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllicher</unclear> den üwern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoge</unclear>-
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stanndnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rübshalben</unclear>. von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemeinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">drÿer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pündten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Räthen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsandtn</unclear>.
<lb n="33"/>so dazemal zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-114" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Chur</placeName> versamlet gewest. Unnd neben denselbenn.
<lb n="34"/>durch einen Erbarn Rath zuo Sannct Gallen. obgemeldt. hievor.
<lb n="35"/>wie dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jetzo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glichsfals</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnderthenig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angesuocht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wordn</unclear>.
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">So</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werdet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ir</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denselben</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Innen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daruff</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iren</unclear>. f. G.
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermeldtn</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selliche</unclear>. ab söllich nachteiligen unnd ver-
<lb n="38"/>derblichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">plackereÿen</unclear>. tragenden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">misfallens</unclear>. und beschwerung.
<lb n="39"/>ferrner für Irer. f. gn. entschuldigung. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">für</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bricht</unclear> gethan. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erfaren</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wordn</unclear>. Unnd dieselb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ire</unclear>. f. G. haben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> gnedig
<lb n="41"/>darfür gehalten. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Üwere</unclear> herren unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obren</unclear>. ouch Ir seien. wur den.
<lb n="42"/>Ire f. G. uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angehörtte</unclear>. unnd Ingenommen bericht.
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">disses</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürstenthumbs</unclear>. unnd Lanndts gelegenheit nach. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetlich</unclear> entschuldigt
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> nemen. nicht beschwerdt. od <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedenckn</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehept</unclear> haben. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Diewÿl</unclear>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abberuerte</unclear> hanndlung. gegen derselben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iren</unclear>. f. G. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jetzo</unclear> aber-
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mals</unclear>. noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ferrner</unclear>. als beschwerlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geandet</unclear>. unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gezogen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">würdet</unclear>.
<lb n="47"/>So <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khönnen</unclear> wir üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meÿnung</unclear> nicht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pergen</unclear>. das dieselb.
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ire</unclear> f. G. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> der zit. etwas <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿtt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">usser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lanndts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verreÿset</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inn</unclear>
<lb n="49"/>derselben Abewëssen aber. Unns als den diennrn. Inn disem hoch-
<lb n="50"/>wichtigen hanndel. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schliessen</unclear>. unnd üch zuo beanntwurtten.
<lb n="51"/>nicht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepüren</unclear> will. Wir sindt aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urpüttig</unclear>. so baldt
<lb n="52"/>hochgedachter unnser gnedig fürst und herr. wider <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lanndt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khomen</unclear>
